---

<BaseLayout>
  <div class="container">
    <section class="page__hero" aria-labelledby="page-heading">
      <h1 id="page-heading" class="page__heading">Bird Proofing</h1>
      <picture class="page__hero-img">
        <source srcset={birdProofingImage.src} media="(min-width: 1200px)" />
        <source srcset={birdProofingImage.src} media="(min-width: 600px)" />
        <img src={birdProofingImage.src} alt="Bird Proofing Image" />
      </picture>
      <p>
        Birds nesting beneath solar panels can cause more problems than most
        homeowners realise. From noise and mess to damaged wiring and reduced
        airflow, bird activity around your solar system can affect both
        performance and long-term reliability. At Solar360 Energy, we provide
        professional solar panel bird proofing solutions designed to protect
        your system without affecting its appearance or efficiency.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our bird proofing systems create a secure barrier around your panels to
        prevent birds from nesting underneath while allowing proper ventilation
        and drainage. Using durable, weather-resistant materials and
        non-invasive installation methods, we help safeguard your solar
        investment and reduce the risk of costly future repairs.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section class="page__main"></section>
    <FaqAccordion items={faqItems} />
    <div class="cta__transition">
      <p>Protect your solar panels from birds, nesting, and costly damage.</p>
    </div>
    <Cta />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
